atom	began(x)	x began to exist
atom	caused(x)	x has a cause
atom	created	something created the universe
P1	S1	all x: began(x) -> caused(x)
P2	S2	began(universe)
C1	S3	caused(universe)	from P1 P2
P3	S4	caused(universe) -> created
C	S5	created	from C1 P3
O1	S6	some x: began(x) & !caused(x)	against P1 R1
R1	S7	all x: !caused(x) -> !began(x)	against O1
